/*
  IncidentForm.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0246 · IncidentForm (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `IncidentForm` resolves (table "IncidentForm") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` / toast English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog (parallel-unsafe across the concurrent slots).

  The first group is the exact user-facing copy from the web source
  (features/system/components/status/IncidentForm.tsx) — the modal title, the
  field labels + notes + prompts, the severity / status option text, the Cancel /
  "Log incident" / "Logging…" actions, and the validation / success / error toasts.
  The remaining keys back the native-only chrome (close button, offline toast,
  toast dismiss, accessibility hints, and the surface label) the state list requires.
*/

